{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object visible, approach and grab it, check properties, bring to location. If path blocked, find new. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = BringObjectToLocation    /> <Action ID = FindNewPath    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    />\"",
